(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(t+1)+2t) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{t+1}+2\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14038045/state.json" "file_sha256" "de533b3f0ea174bc67ccb1cadcf4de20f8d0fa65131bd93e4aba747cdd8130e1"} {"question" "q-336419" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14038045/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "fe66d890c0d20832f8197c4aff0809c957f75deffbbfe81604a7b8ed13ae9c7b"} {"question" "q-336419" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14038045/state.json" "file_sha256" "de533b3f0ea174bc67ccb1cadcf4de20f8d0fa65131bd93e4aba747cdd8130e1"} {"question" "q-336419" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{4}{t+1}+2"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14038045/state.json" "file_sha256" "de533b3f0ea174bc67ccb1cadcf4de20f8d0fa65131bd93e4aba747cdd8130e1"} {"question" "q-102626" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The velocity $v$ of a particle at time $t$ is given by $v(t)={e}^{2-3t}.$ Calculate the acceleration of the particle at time $t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14038045/state.json" "file_sha256" "de533b3f0ea174bc67ccb1cadcf4de20f8d0fa65131bd93e4aba747cdd8130e1"} {"question" "q-102626" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We differentiate $v(t)$ to calculate $a(t):$\n\n$$\